    <p>
      rollingdraft is my workshop. Every project here started as a question, like
      "what does it take to ship a geospatial ML app end to end?", and turned into
      something that runs in public. None of them are ever really finished, hence the name.
    </p>

    <h2>What I work on</h2>
    <p>
      Machine learning, geospatial data and the infrastructure that keeps it running:
      Kubernetes, infrastructure as code and observability.
    </p>

